# AccInt v2 — environment template
# Copy to .env and fill in.

# Required: text-embedding-3-small for substrate retrieval.
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Bridge mode: 'real' for production opencode dispatch (DEFAULT). Tests pin
# 'mock' explicitly via bunfig.toml → tests/preload.ts so `bun test` stays
# hermetic. Set 'mock' here only when you intentionally want non-test paths
# (the harness, the daemon, the CLI) to route through the canned mock —
# rare and almost always a mistake.
ACC2_BRIDGE_MODE=real

# Optional: Daemon ports (auto-pick free ports if unset).
# ACC2_DAEMON_PORT=9387
# ACC2_DAEMON_AUX_PORT=9388

# Optional: opencode CLI flags.
# ACC2_OPENCODE_TIMEOUT_MS=300000
# ACC2_OPENCODE_MCP_HANDSHAKE_MS=120000
# ACC2_OPENCODE_MODEL=openai/gpt-5.5

# Optional: Camoufox binary path (v2 auto-detects ~/.cache/camoufox/camoufox).
# CAMOUFOX_BINARY_PATH=/home/me/.cache/camoufox/camoufox

# Optional: Background workers. ALL default to ON in production — the
# substrate is meant to run the full organism out of the box (embedder
# computing sqlite-vec embeddings, scheduler draining ready dispatches,
# father re-ranking objectives, rolling-reviewer firing cadence-driven
# re-opens, rehab probing quarantined artifacts, integrity scrubbing
# WAL hygiene). Set a worker's gate to `0` ONLY to disable it for an
# unusual setup (e.g. you run a separate father process out-of-band, or
# you are temporarily isolating the embedder during an OpenAI outage).
# Tests pin these to `0` via tests/preload.ts so the unit suite stays
# hermetic. Do NOT set them to "1" — that is the legacy opt-in shape;
# the canonical opt-OUT value is "0".
# ACC2_EMBEDDER_AUTOSTART=0
# ACC2_AUTOSCHEDULER=0
# ACC2_FATHER_AUTOSTART=0
# ACC2_ROLLING_AUTOSTART=0
# ACC2_INTEGRITY_AUTOSTART=0
# ACC2_REHAB_AUTOSTART=0

# Optional: External-push admin token (for /external/push webhook auth).
# ACC2_EXTERNAL_PUSH_TOKEN=...

# Optional: log level (silent | debug | info | warn | error).
# ACC2_LOG_LEVEL=info
# ACC2_LOG_FILE=0
